=== PROPOSAL ===
  ABSTAINED - no permitted action fits the evidence
  if wrong    : This abstention would be shown wrong if the reissued change-history query returns a deploy, image, or flag change on product-catalog or frontend inside the incident window - that would meet rollback_image or revert_config preconditions and make a targeted proposal defensible. It would also be shown wrong if corrected logs reveal a crash-loop or wedged-process signature on frontend, which would meet restart_service's precondition. Until one of those lands, any action here is a guess.
